# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source material — NOT part of the plugin
#
# These are the exported copies of the old hardcoded widgets, plus the
# screenshots used to reverse engineer their layout. They were reference input
# for building the plugin and contain production hostnames, device group names
# and dashboard data. Keep them out of the published repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

librenms-export/
librenms-export2/
librenms-custom-widget-export.tar.gz

# Widget screenshots (reference only)
devicegroupdown/
topbandwith/
uplinkutilization/
upstemp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Images and other binaries
#
# Nothing in this plugin needs a binary asset; widget styling is CSS and the
# icons come from LibreNMS. If you later add screenshots for the README, put
# them in librenms-dashboard-widgets/docs/screenshots/ and uncomment the
# negation at the bottom of this section.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.webp
*.ico
*.svg
*.psd
*.pdf

*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.gz

# Uncomment to allow documentation screenshots:
# !docs/screenshots/
# !docs/screenshots/**

